flowchart LR
    start([Start]) --> check{Evaluation document available?}
    check -->|No| skip[Skip evaluation stage]
    skip --> finish([Stage complete])
    check -->|Yes| chunks[(CPTenderDoc)]
    chunks --> retrieve[Retrieve evaluation evidence]
    retrieve --> agent[Evaluation criteria agent]
    agent --> map[Map evidence to chunks]
    map --> store[(Evaluation criteria results)]
    store --> finish
